  "Full_Content": "<p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">General Studies (Paper - 1) 2025</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q1. Discuss the salient features of the Harappan architecture. </p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q2. Examine the main aspects of Akbar's religious syncretism. </p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q3. The sculptors filled the Chandella artform with resilient vigor and breadth of life. Elucidate. </p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q4. How are climate change and the sea level rise affecting the very existence of many island nations ? Discuss with examples.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q5. What are non-farm primary activities? How are these activities related to physiographic features in India ? Discuss with suitable examples. </p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q6. Explain briefly the ecological and economic benefits of solar energy generation in India with suitable examples. </p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">—</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q7. What are Tsunamis? How and where are they formed? What are their consequences? Explain with examples.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q8. How does smart city in India, address the issues of urban poverty and distributive justice? </p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q9. The ethos of civil service in India stands for the combination of professionalism with nationalistic consciousness – Elucidate.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q10. Do you think that globalization results in only an aggressive consumer culture? Justify your answer.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q11. Mahatma Jotirao Phule’s writings and efforts of social reforms touched issues of almost all subaltern classes. Discuss.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q12. Trace India’s consolidation process during early phase of independence in terms of polity, economy, education and international relations. </p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q13. The French Revolution has enduring relevance to the contemporary world. Explain.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q14. Give a geographical explanation of the distribution of off-shore oil reserves of the world. How are they different from the on-shore occurrences of oil reserves?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; m